{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/d94bf55be05aff6049592d13e453278d.avif?t=1764244056\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras_big/d94bf55be05aff6049592d13e453278d.avif?t=1764244056 width=800 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Formula Legends</i> takes you on a journey through the sport\u2019s most iconic eras. From the roaring machines of the \u201860s to the cutting-edge technology of today, experience the evolution of open-wheel racing in a beautifully stylized world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRIVE THROUGH TIME</strong> - Slide into the cockpit of legendary cars spanning decades of motorsport history. 16 unique models inspired by creations from the 60's through to modern day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/967a499efcb3663b3a77cfd645222db4.poster.avif?t=1764244056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/967a499efcb3663b3a77cfd645222db4.webm?t=1764244056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/967a499efcb3663b3a77cfd645222db4.mp4?t=1764244056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ICONIC CIRCUITS, REIMAGINED</strong> - Race across 14 circuits inspired by historic racing locations, each evolving through the years. From sun-soaked yacht docks to sweeping elevations, these tracks blend nostalgia with a fresh twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/15343b460b18c3ae4307d3d58bf70bf8.poster.avif?t=1764244056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/15343b460b18c3ae4307d3d58bf70bf8.webm?t=1764244056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/15343b460b18c3ae4307d3d58bf70bf8.mp4?t=1764244056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER THE ELEMENTS</strong> - Rain-soaked asphalt, strategic pit stops, and changing eras demand more than just speed. Fine-tune your racecraft, from battery management to slipstreaming, and chase the perfect lap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEGENDS BEHIND THE WHEEL</strong> - Every era has its heroes. Fictional drivers, inspired by real-life icons, come with custom helmets and skill perks: tire whisperers, wet-weather masters, and pit-stop strategists. Their strengths might just be the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A JOURNEY THROUGH RACING HISTORY</strong> - Story Mode invites you to relive the defining moments of Formula racing. Compete in era-based championships, master legendary cars, and carve your name into history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE &amp; COMPETE</strong> - Create your own custom races and championships, climb the global leaderboards in Time Attack, and personalize your ride with modding support\u2014from liveries to helmets and trackside sponsors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/7f5948363c1c162d5e80ff5169ac5694.poster.avif?t=1764244056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/7f5948363c1c162d5e80ff5169ac5694.webm?t=1764244056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/7f5948363c1c162d5e80ff5169ac5694.mp4?t=1764244056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First to join","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194360/606ffe6c451ee54d70987ca497559f08184b79e0.jpg"},{"name":"Complete collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194360/1fa0ecc738641a70cca7ad6ae24241041d2e3f4d.jpg"},{"name":"Trackmania","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194360/81574489c69251cbd343927fc2b31e526364a04a.jpg"},{"name":"Well begun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194360/868c04850abaf06e290fb08edb6732d6922f2bb4.jpg"},{"name":"Time addicted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194360/f5b546234be8be50c5b5966cfb35c6db5afec436.jpg"},{"name":"True fan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194360/72be24eb2077acf282b2eed9200d8d250b7ed16e.jpg"},{"name":"Tireless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194360/504b6a77ec81fc3c870aaeb84c87e023a735e587.jpg"},{"name":"Don't break the rules","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194360/52b8c1ab7c07a5d55390999f49a99604413ea13c.jpg"},{"name":"Pit Stop expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194360/7c4969f220dac374d19d8b7a845d9cce77148693.jpg"},{"name":"Lost in the forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta